  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting inclusive education opportunities for children with disabilities in Lesotho</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide children with disabilities in Lesotho with the support and opportunities they need to help them fulfil their potential, physically, intellectually, and socially. POP Lesotho will aim to build on its achievements, increase the capacity of stakeholders to assess and provide Assistive Technology (AT) and support infrastructure and training facilities for children with cerebral palsy.</narrative>
  </description>
